          "definitionKey": "racial-trait:214107",
          "entityTypeId": 1960452172,
          "displayOrder": null,
          "name": "Legacy of Minauros",
          "description": "<p>You know the mage hand cantrip. When you reach 3rd level, you can cast the Tenser’s floating disk spell once with this trait and regain the ability to do so when you finish a short or long rest. When you reach 5th level, you can cast the arcane lock spell once with this trait, requiring no material component, and regain the ability to do so when you finish a long rest. Charisma is your spellcasting ability for these spells.</p>",
          "snippet": "You know the mage hand cantrip. [3rd] You can cast Tenser's floating disk (2nd) once per short or long rest. [5th] You can cast arcane lock once per long rest. CHA is your spellcasting ability.",
